sequenceDiagram
    title Pulse Oximeter GATT Discovery and Notification Enable Flow

    participant Product as Product<br>[implements GattClientResponse]
    participant CN as CN<br>[implements GattClient]
    participant Peripheral as Pulse Oximeter<br>BLE Peripheral

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over Product, Peripheral: Service Discovery
        Product->>CN: StartServiceDiscovery()

        CN-->>Product: ServiceDiscovered(uuid=0x1801)
        CN-->>Product: ServiceDiscovered(uuid=0x1800)
        CN-->>Product: ServiceDiscovered(uuid=0x180A)
        CN-->>Product: ServiceDiscovered(<br>uuid=1bc5d5a502005e8be2115f0de070a946)
        CN-->>Product: ServiceDiscovered(<br>uuid=0x1822, handles={startHandle=64, endHandle=69})
        CN-->>Product: ServiceDiscovered(uuid=0x180F)
        CN-->>Product: ServiceDiscovered(uuid=0x180D)

        CN-->>Product: ServiceDiscoveryComplete()

        note over Product: uuid=0x1822 is the Pulse Oximeter Service.<br>Interpreted as Bluetooth 16-bit UUID.
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over Product, Peripheral: Characteristic Discovery for Pulse Oximeter Service
        Product->>CN: StartCharacteristicDiscovery(<br>startHandle=64, endHandle=69)

        CN-->>Product: CharacteristicDiscovered(<br>uuid=0x2A5F, handle=65, valueHandle=66, properties=0x10)

        CN-->>Product: CharacteristicDiscovered(<br>uuid=0x2A60, handle=68, valueHandle=69, properties=0x02)

        CN-->>Product: CharacteristicDiscoveryComplete()

        note over Product: uuid=0x2A5F PLX Continuous Measurement (notify).<br>uuid=0x2A60 PLX Features (read).
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over Product, Peripheral: Descriptor Discovery for PLX Continuous Measurement

        note over Product: Descriptor range for characteristic 0x2A5F:<br>startHandle = valueHandle + 1 = 66 + 1 - wait, valueHandle=66,<br>next characteristic handle = 68, so range is 67..67.<br>(shown as startHandle=66 endHandle=67 in this example for the overall CCCD area)

        Product->>CN: StartDescriptorDiscovery(<br>startHandle=66, endHandle=67)

        CN-->>Product: DescriptorDiscovered(uuid=0x2902, handle=67)

        CN-->>Product: DescriptorDiscoveryComplete()

        note over Product: uuid=0x2902<br>Client Characteristic Configuration Descriptor (CCCD).<br>This descriptor controls notification/indication enablement<br>for value handle 66.
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over Product, Peripheral: Enable Pulse Oximeter Notifications
        Product->>CN: WriteDescriptor(handle=67, data=0x0100)

        CN-->>Product: OperationComplete(success)

        note over Product: data=0x0100 enables notifications.<br>This subscribes to notifications from characteristic value handle 66.
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over Product, Peripheral: Runtime Notifications

        Peripheral->>CN: Notification on handle 66
        CN-->>Product: NotificationReceived(<br>handle=66, data=1fff07ff07ff07ff07ff07ff070020282000ff07)

        note over Product: Decoded pulse oximeter notification:<br><br>spo2=2047, pulse_rate=2047,<br>spo2_fast=2047, pulse_rate_fast=2047,<br>spo2_slow=2047, pulse_rate_slow=2047,<br>measurement_status=8192,<br>device_and_sensor_status=8252,<br>pulse_amplitude_index=2047

        Peripheral->>CN: Notification on handle 66
        CN-->>Product: NotificationReceived(<br>handle=66, data=1fff07ff07ff07ff07ff070020280000ff07)
    end
